7334 0 obj
  << /ActualText (ReKraft is a values\021anchored mobile concept that translates Kaitiakitanga\024the M\001ori principle of guardianship\024into practical community action\056 The project integrates Te Ao M\001ori with SDG 12 to close the intent\023action gap in sustainability by enabling people to share creative reuse\054 trade or share materials and DIY items\054 and learn cultural and environmental values\056 \nAs a PM and UX designer\054 I led the research and design framework\054 defined the information architecture and user flows\054 produced low\021to\021high\021fidelity prototypes and brand\057visual assets\054 and validated a cohesive \034share\023trade\023learn\035 pathway that reduces waste\054 extends item lifecycles\054 and fosters community stewardship\056)
     /K [ 15 ]
     /P 7335 0 R
     /Pg 7304 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

