  << /ActualText (We combined desk and contextual research on M\001ori values\054 policies\054 precedents\054 and markets with co\021analysis \050affinity synthesis\051\054 then articulated actionable principles and scope\056 We translated these into information architecture\054 user flows\054 and iterative prototypes \050low\057mid\057high fidelity\051\054 and validated with tasks that exercise community sharing\054 marketplace transactions\054 and learning missions\073 throughout\054 We applied culturally respectful integration of Te Ao M\001ori and ensured accessibility\021first UI decisions\056)
     /K [ 77 ]
