7510 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The discovery clarified the cultural foundation of Kaitiakitanga as reciprocal stewardship of land\054 sea\054 and sky\054 and mapped today\031s sustainability context where policy support and community initiatives exist but everyday reuse remains hard\056 Market and precedent reviews surfaced gaps\072 mainstream platforms excel at commerce or inspiration\054 but do not combine reuse literacy\054 community reciprocity\054 and M\001ori values\056 Technique scans explored AI recognition precedents for reuse suggestions\073 together\054 these inputs framed opportunities to connect cultural meaning with practical tools that lower barriers to action\056)
     /K [ 103 ]
     /P 7511 0 R
     /Pg 7304 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

