7892 0 obj
  << /ActualText (This project demonstrates that cultural integration is most powerful when expressed through everyday agency\054 not just visuals\072 reframing detailed findings as principles clarified decisions\073 adopting accessibility standards \050type scale\054 contrast\054 targets\051 improved real\021world usability\073 and while usability testing achieved task\021level validation\054 future work should broaden sampling and deepen analysis to strengthen evidence\056 Respectful collaboration\024with M\001ori practitioners and community groups\024will further enhance authenticity and nuance\056)
